        115.38463592529297,
        527.4161987304688,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "High tuberculosis transmission setting:  Setting with a high frequency of people with undetected",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.4092407226562,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "or undiagnosed TB disease, or where people with infectious TB are present and there is a high risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.5905151367188,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "of TB transmission. People with TB are most infectious when they are untreated or inadequately",
